{"ID":"20240504170623-hs8ssf4","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504170623-hs8ssf4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504170623-hs8ssf4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624083816-jx8s10d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611121711-ci8b0ad\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624084123-wlo21if\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"149凝水石（寒水石）","type":"doc","updated":"20240813114010"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240813113126-90euqae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813113126-90euqae","updated":"20240813113128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240624083816-jx8s10d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624083816-jx8s10d","updated":"20240813112527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 507px;","style":"width: 497px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凝水石"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凝水石-20240624083816-73e0jbo.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 497px;\" parent-style=\"width: 507px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813112957-enz3xuk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813112957-enz3xuk","updated":"20240813112957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 597px;","style":"width: 587px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"寒水石 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/寒水石 4-20240813112937-lum8577.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 587px;\" parent-style=\"width: 597px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813112732-13gjjcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813112732-13gjjcn","updated":"20240813112732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 599px;","style":"width: 589px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"寒水石 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/寒水石 2-20240813112732-kyelzuc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 589px;\" parent-style=\"width: 599px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813112610-ubt5aob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813112610-ubt5aob","updated":"20240813113131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 600px;","style":"width: 590px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"寒水石"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/寒水石-20240813112610-125mi5b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 590px;\" parent-style=\"width: 600px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813112652-mwd35ww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813112652-mwd35ww","updated":"20240813114010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 601px;","style":"width: 591px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"寒水石 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/寒水石 1-20240813112652-k3mvyoq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 591px;\" parent-style=\"width: 601px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240611121342-uqu8k1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121342-uqu8k1o","updated":"20240624084113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：寒水石，味辛咸，性大寒。清热降火，除烦止渴。功能主治与石膏相近，性寒胜于石膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121342-fa8xzh7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121342-fa8xzh7"}},{"ID":"20240611121343-4vh83mn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121343-4vh83mn","updated":"20240611121356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凝水石《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121343-lkiugfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121343-lkiugfe","updated":"20240611121343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121343-nd1vtr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121343-nd1vtr2","updated":"20240611121343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主身热，腹中积聚，邪气，皮中如火烧，烦满，水饮之。久服不饥。一名白水石。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121343-usxp1vo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121343-usxp1vo","updated":"20240611121343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：神农辛，吱伯医和扁鹊甘无毒。李氏大寒，或生邯郸，采无时，如云母色（《御览》引云，一名寒水石）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121343-t57g0ht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121343-t57g0ht","updated":"20240611121343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名寒水石，一名凌水石，盐之精也，生常案及凝山，又中水县邯郸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121343-fmm8ag9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121343-fmm8ag9","updated":"20240611121343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《范子计然》云：水石出河东，色泽者善。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121343-8upxp36","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121343-8upxp36"}},{"ID":"20240611121432-g9ddh8o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121432-g9ddh8o","updated":"20240611121443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凝水石《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121432-mncswa5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121432-mncswa5","updated":"20240611121432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、甘，寒、大寒，无毒。主身热，腹中积聚邪气，皮中如火烧，烦满，水饮之。除时气热盛，五脏伏热，胃中热，烦满，止渴，水肿，小腹痹。久服不饥。一名白水石，一名寒水石，一名凌水石。色如云母可析者良，盐之精也。生常山山谷，又中水县及邯郸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121432-za0vppf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121432-za0vppf","updated":"20240611121432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（解巴豆毒，畏地榆。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611121432-nvwop0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121432-nvwop0i","updated":"20240611121432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶常山属并州，中水县属河间郡，邯郸即赵郡，并属冀州域。此处地皆咸卤，故云盐精，而碎之亦似朴硝。此石末置水中，夏月能为冰者佳。唐本注∶此石有两种，有纵理、横理，色清明者为佳。或云纵理为寒水石，横理为凝水石。今出同州韩城，色青黄，理如云母为良；出澄城者，斜理纹，色白，为劣也。臣禹锡等谨按吴氏云∶神农∶辛。岐伯、医和、扁鹊∶甘，无毒。季氏∶大寒。或生邯郸。采无时，如云母色。药性论云∶寒水石，能压丹石毒风，去心烦渴闷，解伤寒劳复。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121432-hr7bdde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121432-hr7bdde","updated":"20240611121432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶凝水石，即寒水石也，生常山山谷，又出中水县及邯郸，今河东汾、隰州及德顺军有之。此有两种，有纵理者，有横理者，色清明如云母可析，投置水中，与水同色，其水凝动者为佳。或曰纵理者为寒水石，横理者为凝水石。三月采。又有一种冷油石，全与此相类，但投沸油铛中，油即冷者是也。此石有毒，若误用之，令腰以下不能举。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121432-54g2c1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121432-54g2c1v","updated":"20240611121432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡使，先须用生姜自然汁，煮汁尽为度，细研成粉用。每修十两，用姜汁一镒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121432-0koph6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121432-0koph6r","updated":"20240611121432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经验方∶治小儿丹毒，皮肤热赤。用寒水石半两，白土一分，捣罗为末，用米醋调敷之愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121432-1f3qete","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121432-1f3qete","updated":"20240611121432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"集日，净地坑内盆合，四面湿土拥起，候经宿取出，入甘草末、天竺黄各二两，龙脑二分，糯米膏丸弹子大，蜜水磨下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121432-68a0o8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121432-68a0o8p","updated":"20240611121432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒类要∶治肉瘅，其人小便白。以凝水石主之也。丹房镜源∶凝水石可作油衣，可食，制丹砂为匮伏玄精。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121432-a84064h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121432-a84064h","updated":"20240611121432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶凝水石，又谓之寒水石，纹理通澈，人或磨刻为枕，以备暑月之用。入药须烧过，或市人烧入腻粉中以乱真，不可不察也。陶隐居言∶夏月能为冰者佳。如此，则举世不能得，似乎失言。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121433-oo6i68x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121433-oo6i68x"}},{"ID":"20240611121455-c836br1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121455-c836br1","updated":"20240611121503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凝水石《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121455-1beek5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121455-1beek5d","updated":"20240611121455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛甘，寒，大寒，无毒，主身热，腹中积聚邪气，皮中如火烧，烦满，水饮之，除时气热盛，五脏伏热，胃中热，烦满，止渴，水肿，小腹痹。久服不饥。一名白水石，一名寒水石，一名凌水石，色如云母可析者良，盐之精也。生常山山谷，又水中县及邯郸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121457-ypzp0kr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121457-ypzp0kr"}},{"ID":"20240611121516-rniln1p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121516-rniln1p","updated":"20240611121523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凝水石《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121516-fbukii9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121516-fbukii9","updated":"20240611121516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"亦名寒水石。即盐精石。（一名泥精。昔人谓之盐枕。今人谓之盐根。）生于卤地积盐之下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121516-rseywz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121516-rseywz4","updated":"20240611121516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大块有齿棱。如马牙硝。清莹如水晶。亦有带青黑色者。打破皆方。暑月回润。入水浸久亦化。苏颂注元精石。谓解池有盐精石。味更咸苦。乃元精之类。固是物也。（濒湖）寒水石有二。一是软石膏。一是凝水石。唐宋以来。诸家不详本文盐精之说。遂误以石膏方解石为寒水石。而盐精之寒水绝不知用。此千载之误也。然则古方所用寒水石。正即此种凝水石。唐宋诸方寒水石是石膏。近方寒水石则是长石方解石耳。（参用濒湖）味辛咸甘。气大寒。本经主治身热。腹中积聚邪气。皮中如火烧。烦满。（水饮之）除时气热盛。五脏伏热。胃中热。止渴凉血。降火止牙疼。坚牙明目。入肾走血。除热之功。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121516-a4lfjqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121516-a4lfjqd","updated":"20240611121516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同于诸盐。经曰。小热之气。凉以和之。大热之气。寒以取之。又曰。热淫于内。治以咸寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121516-9sinhat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121516-9sinhat","updated":"20240611121516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凝水〔论〕苏氏以凝水石为元精之类。而东璧氏遂无分别。今细绎之。同中觉有异处。观二石之释名。同禀水气。而凝水止曰寒水。元精则曰太乙元精。同为盐结。而凝水止曰盐精。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121516-hz5qyu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121516-hz5qyu8","updated":"20240611121516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"元精则曰阴精。岂得谓无少异乎。说见元精石条。能除有余邪热。凡阴虚火旺。咳嗽吐血多痰。潮热骨蒸。并脾胃作泻者。慎弗误服。（仲淳）〔修治〕每凝水十两。须用生姜二十两捣取自然汁煮干。研粉用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121517-x0quxs4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121517-x0quxs4"}},{"ID":"20240611121538-nj4zpvm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121538-nj4zpvm","updated":"20240611121546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凝水石《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121538-eh7exmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121538-eh7exmd","updated":"20240611121538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"泻热．"}]},{"ID":"20240611121538-osih1o3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121538-osih1o3","updated":"20240611121538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛咸大寒．治时气热盛．口渴水肿．盐精渗入土中．年久结成．清莹有棱．入水即化．"}]},{"ID":"20240611121538-u3nrynd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121538-u3nrynd","updated":"20240611121538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"亦名寒水石．（古方所用寒水石、是凝水石、唐宋诸方用寒水石、即石膏．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611121539-dpp75s5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121539-dpp75s5"}},{"ID":"20240611121611-jxkha61","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121611-jxkha61","updated":"20240611121619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凝水石《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121611-ttfo74c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121611-ttfo74c","updated":"20240611121611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名寒水石，一名盐精石。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121611-rt3f4yu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121611-rt3f4yu","updated":"20240611121611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"畏地榆。制丹砂。解巴豆毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121611-k4sjcnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121611-k4sjcnt","updated":"20240611121611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛、咸、寒。入足少阴经血分。凉血降火。治时气热盛，五脏伏热，皮如火烧，伤寒劳复，坚齿明目，涂小儿丹毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121611-kr6i6my","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121611-kr6i6my","updated":"20240611121611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得朱砂、甘草、冰片研细末，掺牙龈出血。得滑石、葵子，治男女转脬。（过忍小便而致者。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611121611-2gdf2b3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121611-2gdf2b3","updated":"20240611121611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卤地积盐之下渗入土中，年久至泉，结而成石，清莹有齿，棱如马牙硝，入水即化。以生姜自然汁煮干，研用。胃弱者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121611-379vcbz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121611-379vcbz","updated":"20240611121611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"古方所用寒水石，是此石。唐宋诸方寒水石，是石膏。近方寒水石，是长石、方解石。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121612-rf0itam","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121612-rf0itam"}},{"ID":"20240611121633-i1ultig","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121633-i1ultig","updated":"20240611121639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凝水石《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121633-gftrr7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121633-gftrr7b","updated":"20240611121633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即寒水石"}]},{"ID":"20240611121633-gqa0gnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121633-gqa0gnb","updated":"20240611121633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛咸寒，无毒。近世真者绝不易得，欲验真伪，含之即化为真，否即是伪。石膏亦名寒水石，与此不同。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121633-zw2maxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121633-zw2maxe","updated":"20240611121633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主身热，腹中积聚邪气，皮中如火烧，烦满。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121633-3t5lj9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121633-3t5lj9k","updated":"20240611121633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒水石生积盐之下，得阴凝之气而成，盐之精也。治心肾积热之上药。《本经》治腹中积聚，咸能软坚也。身热皮中如火烧，咸能降火也。《金匮》风引汤，《局方》紫雪，皆用以治有余之邪热也。如无真者，戎盐、玄精石皆可代用，总取咸寒降泄之用耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121634-l7bf52d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121634-l7bf52d"}},{"ID":"20240611121645-pk8knge","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121645-pk8knge","updated":"20240611121651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒水石《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121645-jjiow0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121645-jjiow0z","updated":"20240611121645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（石）解火热利水道"}]},{"ID":"20240611121645-m1mulns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121645-m1mulns","updated":"20240611121645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒水石（专入胃肾）。又名凝水石。又名白水石。生于卤地。因盐精渗入土中。年久结聚。清莹有棱而成也。味辛而咸。气寒无毒。书载能治时行大热口渴水肿。盖以性禀纯阴故也。经曰。热淫于内。治以咸寒。又曰。小热之气。凉以和之。大热之气。寒以收之。服此治热利水。适相宜耳。（永类方男女转脬不得小便。寒水石二两。滑石一两。葵子一合。水煎即利。易简方汤火伤。用寒水石烧研敷。经验方小儿丹毒皮肤热赤。用寒水石半两。白土一分。为末。醋调涂。）然此止可暂治有余之邪。及敷汤火水伤。若虚人热浮。其切忌焉。莹白含之即化者真。否即是伪。但真者绝少。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121646-rdbsg7q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121646-rdbsg7q"}},{"ID":"20240611121655-zqt8s5p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121655-zqt8s5p","updated":"20240611121701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒水石《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121655-zp8lni1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121655-zp8lni1","updated":"20240611121655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名凝水石，又名白水石，生于卤地盐之精也。禀积阴之气而成，味辛、咸，气大寒，无毒。《经》曰∶小热之气，凉以和之；大热之气，寒以取之。又曰∶热淫于内，治以咸寒。故大寒微咸之气，以为软坚去滞除热利水之需，然只可暂治有余邪热及敷汤火所伤。若虚人虚热，并宜切禁。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121655-nlx9lkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121655-nlx9lkh","updated":"20240611121655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒水石，却胃中热，及五脏伏热，解巴豆毒，并丹石诸毒伤寒劳复，兼治积聚邪热，亦除烦渴饮水，胃热牙痛，水肿，小腹作痛，凉血降火神剂。汤火所伤，敷搽即愈。未溃者，研末油调；已破者，研末干掺。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121655-7naoprc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121655-7naoprc","updated":"20240611121655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治（痘疹合参） 功效同前。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121812-z0346r9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121812-z0346r9"}},{"ID":"20240611121813-xe503tw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121813-xe503tw","updated":"20240611121817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒水石《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121813-sfs7146","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121813-sfs7146","updated":"20240611121813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛咸重寒无毒．清肺胃．并入大肠．温邪暑热有功．解渴烦．且凉血分．（寒水石此石即古之方解石．敲之块块方解．其光洁如白石英．烧之不软．大抵性寒质重．色白之品．与石膏主治相同．惟用者甚罕耳．古之寒水石．即凝水石．产于盐地．入水即化．其咸寒入肾．走血除热之功．较方解石膏等石为胜耳．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611121835-1nwqgwv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121835-1nwqgwv"}},{"ID":"20240611121836-sg45wvo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121836-sg45wvo","updated":"20240611121840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒水石《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121836-fgzv2gd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121836-fgzv2gd","updated":"20240611121836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名凝水石，又名白水石，生于卤地盐之精也。禀积阴之气而成，味辛、咸，气大寒，无毒。《经》曰∶小热之气，凉以和之；大热之气，寒以取之。又曰∶热淫于内，治以咸寒。故大寒微咸之气，以为软坚去滞除热利水之需，然只可暂治有余邪热及敷汤火所伤。若虚人虚热，并宜切禁。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121836-r4ltx0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121836-r4ltx0r","updated":"20240611121836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒水石，却胃中热，及五脏伏热，解巴豆毒，并丹石诸毒伤寒劳复，兼治积聚邪热，亦除烦渴饮水，胃热牙痛，水肿，小腹作痛，凉血降火神剂。汤火所伤，敷搽即愈。未溃者，研末油调；已破者，研末干掺。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121836-znytqbs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121836-znytqbs","updated":"20240611121836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治（痘疹合参） 功效同前。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121825-219tjzc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121825-219tjzc"}},{"ID":"20240611121826-b6tk2x8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121826-b6tk2x8","updated":"20240611121830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒水石《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121826-rzdheri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121826-rzdheri","updated":"20240611121826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（石）解火热利水道"}]},{"ID":"20240611121826-7ukg29y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121826-7ukg29y","updated":"20240611121826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒水石（专入胃肾）。又名凝水石。又名白水石。生于卤地。因盐精渗入土中。年久结聚。清莹有棱而成也。味辛而咸。气寒无毒。书载能治时行大热口渴水肿。盖以性禀纯阴故也。经曰。热淫于内。治以咸寒。又曰。小热之气。凉以和之。大热之气。寒以收之。服此治热利水。适相宜耳。（永类方男女转脬不得小便。寒水石二两。滑石一两。葵子一合。水煎即利。易简方汤火伤。用寒水石烧研敷。经验方小儿丹毒皮肤热赤。用寒水石半两。白土一分。为末。醋调涂。）然此止可暂治有余之邪。及敷汤火水伤。若虚人热浮。其切忌焉。莹白含之即化者真。否即是伪。但真者绝少。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121716-x5tms0w","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121716-x5tms0w"}},{"ID":"20240611121723-60ufj7v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121723-60ufj7v","updated":"20240611121737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒水石《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121723-s122e4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121723-s122e4r","updated":"20240611121723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药用】本品为天然沉积矿物单斜晶系硫酸钙或三方晶系碳酸钙矿石。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121723-qsyj3re","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121723-qsyj3re","updated":"20240611121723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】辛、咸，大寒。入胃、肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121723-h6impoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121723-h6impoa","updated":"20240611121723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】清热泻火"}]},{"ID":"20240611121723-2j61l2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121723-2j61l2j","updated":"20240611121723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】用于温热病壮热、烦渴等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121723-g3jcvpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121723-g3jcvpb","updated":"20240611121723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒水石清热泻火的功效，与石膏相类似，故常与石膏配伍，用于壮热烦渴的症候。如治暑温邪在气分，大热烦渴、苔黄等症，可与石膏、滑石、杏仁、竹茹、银花、通草等同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121723-q83jhmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121723-q83jhmr","updated":"20240611121723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，本品可外用于风热火眼及水火烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121723-x75tdgc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121723-x75tdgc","updated":"20240611121723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】寒水石（打碎用）"}]},{"ID":"20240611121723-fcc7psg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121723-fcc7psg","updated":"20240611121723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】三钱至一两，煎服，先煎。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121723-gie0uqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121723-gie0uqr","updated":"20240611121723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】三石汤《温病条辨》：飞滑石、寒水石、生石膏、杏仁、竹茹、金银花、白通草、金汁。治暑温邪在气分，大热烦渴、苔黄等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121656-tcf7bxj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121656-tcf7bxj"}},{"ID":"20240611121709-gkor4xj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-gkor4xj","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：寒水石"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-3expiae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-3expiae","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-tuncba7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-tuncba7","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Hán Shuǐ Shí"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-61exov7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-61exov7","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-3ac08a2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-3ac08a2","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 红石膏、方解石"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-l88ynja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-l88ynja","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-62lh28f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-62lh28f","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药用寒水石有两种，即"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"红石膏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"与"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"方解石"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"红石膏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为一种天然的硫酸钙矿石；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"方解石"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为碳酸钙矿石。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-kth46b8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-kth46b8","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-4tujgtj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-4tujgtj","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 红石膏：呈不规则的扁平块状，大小不一，粉红色，略有光泽，表面凹凸不平，侧面有纵纹理。质硬而脆，易砸碎，断面粉红色，有纵纹理。无臭，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-9ujncgw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-9ujncgw","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方解石：多呈规则的块状结晶，常呈斜方柱形，有棱角，无色或黄白色，透明、略透明或不透明，表面平滑，有玻璃样光泽。质坚硬，易砸碎，碎块为方形或长方形。无臭，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-k3lg93r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-k3lg93r","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-2uczx5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-2uczx5s","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 煅寒水石：取净寒水石，置坩锅或其他容器内，在无烟的炉火中煅至红透，取出放凉，捣碎或研粉即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-1rmcsxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-1rmcsxp","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-2xrq8a3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-2xrq8a3","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛、咸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-3q0ihxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-3q0ihxf","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-a95jiej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-a95jiej","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热泻火，除烦止渴。用于发热烦渴，咽喉肿痛，口舌生疮，牙痛；外用治烧烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-iki01um","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-iki01um","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-r558jp4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-r558jp4","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 2～5钱；外用适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-j6r9ba6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-j6r9ba6","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-9ljdaan","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-9ljdaan","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）寒水石清热泻火的功效，与石膏相类似，故常与石膏配伍，用于壮热烦渴的症候。如治暑温邪在气分，大热烦渴、苔黄等症，可与石膏、滑石、杏仁、竹茹、银花、通草等同用。此外，本品可外用于风热火眼及水火烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-ztquy9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-ztquy9y","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-mjmwbqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-mjmwbqz","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-g1f6m6m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-g1f6m6m","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：寒水石"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-5266i6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-5266i6t","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-nnriy7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-nnriy7v","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Hán Shuǐ Shí"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-dmpbn3z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-dmpbn3z","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-0f72nwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-0f72nwb","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 凝水石、白水石（《本经》），凌水石（《别录》），盐精（《丹房鉴源》），水石、冰石（《石药尔雅》），鹊石（《本事方》），盐精石、泥精、盐枕、盐根（《纲目》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-4u5ncze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-4u5ncze","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-tekzexg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-tekzexg","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《吴普本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-mzmob5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-mzmob5v","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-2rmnuyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-2rmnuyi","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为硫酸盐类矿物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"芒硝"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"晶体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-h3mxd25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-h3mxd25","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-i9sw8m2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-i9sw8m2","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 矿物形态详\"芒硝\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-jhrrujc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-jhrrujc","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》所载的寒水石，据考证应为芒硝的天然晶体，但近代寒水石药材的商品，有红石膏与方解石二种，前者多用于北方，后者多用于南方。矿物形态参见\"石膏\"及\"方解石\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-438m8g1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-438m8g1","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-du8jx5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-du8jx5p","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入心、胃、肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-i78iny8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-i78iny8","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"入肾走血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-ul41icu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-ul41icu","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草新编》：\"入胃经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-76rp2qw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-76rp2qw","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草撮要》：\"入手足少阴、太阴、阳明经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-jxjepr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-jxjepr6","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-twq55fj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-twq55fj","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛咸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-5m1a0k2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-5m1a0k2","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"辛，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-nfpyg42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-nfpyg42","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"辛，咸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-1sx5klt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-1sx5klt","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-6dkgu2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-6dkgu2l","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 脾胃虚寒者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-5dyitq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-5dyitq7","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经集注》：\"畏地输。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-ym7g7qw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-ym7g7qw","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"凡阴虚火旺，咳嗽吐血，多痰，潮热骨蒸，并脾胃作泄者不宜服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-qwnv11r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-qwnv11r","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草求真》：\"虚人热浮，切忌。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-84chlr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-84chlr7","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-g261deu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-g261deu","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热降火，利窍，消肿。治时行热病，积热烦渴，吐泻，水肿，尿闭，齿衄，丹毒，烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-ro1dh57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-ro1dh57","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主身热，腹中积聚邪气，皮中如火烧，烦满，水饮之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-hrzs4gh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-hrzs4gh","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经集注》：\"解巴豆毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-gjg0rx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-gjg0rx3","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》：\"除时气热盛，五脏伏热，胃中热，烦满，口渴，水肿，小腹痹。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-q7bn33d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-q7bn33d","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《医学入门》：\"治小儿丹毒，烧为末，醋调敷之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-mc2v8ft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-mc2v8ft","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《纲目》：\"治小便白，内痹，凉血降火，止牙疼，坚牙明目。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-j2relez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-j2relez","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《医林纂要》：\"除妄热，治天行大热及霍乱吐泻，心烦口渴，湿热水肿。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-j4btpcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-j4btpcr","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草求真》：\"敷汤火伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-72a9kw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-72a9kw7","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《本草求原》：\"治心肾实热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-1xuzped","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-1xuzped","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-z4b45ma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-z4b45ma","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3～5钱；或入丸、散。外用：研末掺或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-8snanw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-8snanw1","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-vgcecun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-vgcecun","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治五脏六腑积热，天行时气疫热，以致烦满消渴：凝水石、石膏、滑石各五钱，甘草二钱。研末。每服一钱，白汤调服。（《方脉正宗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-cmtjt53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-cmtjt53","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治伤寒发狂，或弃衣奔走，逾墙上屋：寒水石、黄连（去须）各等分。上细末，每服二钱，浓煎甘草汤，放冷调服。（《本事方》鹊石散）"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-wu5lg1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-wu5lg1h","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③除热瘫痫：大黄、干姜、龙骨各四两，桂枝三两，甘草、牡蛎各二两，寒水石、滑石、亦石脂、白石脂、紫石英、石膏各六两。上十二味，杵，粗筛，以韦囊盛之，取三指撮，井花水三升，煮三沸，温服一升。（《金匮要略》风引汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-6fptost","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-6fptost","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治风热心躁，口干狂言，浑身壮热及中诸毒：寒水石半斤（烧半日，净地坑内，盆合，四面湿土壅起，候经宿取出），入甘草末、天竺黄各二两，龙脑二分。糯米膏丸，弹子大，蜜水磨下。（《姚僧坦集验方》龙脑甘露丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-dvg18zx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-dvg18zx","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治男女转脬，不得小便：寒水石二两，滑石一两，葵子一合。为末。水一斗，煮五升，时服，一升即利。（《永类钤方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-mghjduz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-mghjduz","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治小儿丹毒，皮肤热赤：凝水石五钱，水调和猪胆汁涂之。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-ik6qi26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-ik6qi26","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治牙齿内血出，并有窍眼，时时吐血：寒水石粉、朱砂、甘草、脑子。上等分，为细末。每用少许，干掺有窍处。（《普济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-ptd9j6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-ptd9j6z","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治汤火伤灼：寒水石烧研敷之。（《卫生易简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-re2uybz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-re2uybz","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-lk8hg3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-lk8hg3j","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：\"凝水石其气太寒，其味辛咸，入肾走血，除热之功，同于诸盐。古方所用寒水石是此石，唐、宋诸方寒水石是石膏，近方寒水石则是长石、方解石。用者详之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-ujchexp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-ujchexp","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"凝水石，《本经》味辛气寒，《别录》加甘，大寒无毒。《经》曰，小热之气，凉以和之，大热之气，寒以取之。又曰，热淫于内，治以咸寒。大寒微咸之性，故主身热邪气，皮中如火烧，烦满，及时气热盛。五脏伏热，胃中热也，易饥作渴，亦胃中伏火也，甘寒除阳明之邪热，故能止渴不饥。水肿者湿热也，小便多不利，以致水气上溢于腹，而成腹痹，辛咸走散之性，故能除热利窍消肿也。疗腹中积聚者，亦取其辛散咸软之功耳。\"\"凝水石，按本文云盐之精，则与石膏、方解石大相悬绝矣。因石膏有寒水石之名，而王隐君复云寒水石又名方解石，以致混淆难辨，其功能各不同，用者自宜分别。生卤地，味辛咸，碎之如朴硝者，是凝水石。其气大寒，能除有余邪热。《经》曰诸腹胀大，皆属于热者宜之，请湿肿满属脾土者忌之，大宜详审，慎勿有误。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-6f5tdeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-6f5tdeb","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本经逢原》：\"寒水石，治心肾积热之上药，《本经》治腹中积聚，咸能软坚也；身热皮中如火烧，咸能降火也。《金匮》风引汤，《局方》紫雪，皆用以治有余之邪热也。如无真者，戎盐、玄精石皆可代用，总取咸寒降泄之用耳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-4p86jbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-4p86jbq","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-wsrl2ry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-wsrl2ry","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-5zgq759","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-5zgq759","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：寒水石"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-vduhoeh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-vduhoeh","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-hywy7es","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-hywy7es","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Hán Shuǐ Shí"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-a17akne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-a17akne","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-96e7p89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-96e7p89","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 凝水石、白水石、凌水石、盐精、水石、冰石、鹊石、盐精石、泥精、盐枕、盐根"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-sadvyqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-sadvyqj","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-3dwkcq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-3dwkcq7","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Crystalline Mirabilite， Gypsum，Calcite"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-7rzi2sl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-7rzi2sl","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-drma6sm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-drma6sm","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《吴普本草》。《本草》所载的寒水石，据考证应为芒硝的天然晶体，但近代寒水石药材的商品，有红石膏与方解石二种，前者多用于北方，后者多用于南方。原矿物参见石膏及方解石条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-vh0yrm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-vh0yrm5","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《名医别录》：凝水石，色如云母，可拆者良，盐精也。生常山山谷又中水县及邯郸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-0ci2uvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-0ci2uvy","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.陶弘景：常山属并州，中水县属河间郡，邯郸即赵郡并属冀州域， 此处地皆咸卤，故云盐精，而碎之亦似朴硝。此石末置水中，夏月能为冰者佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-dcb7l8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-dcb7l8h","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-216lv0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-216lv0r","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为硫酸盐类石膏族矿物石膏或为碳酸盐类方解石族矿物方解石。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-4xfhxye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-4xfhxye","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Gypsum;Calcite"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-4q3eu2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-4q3eu2e","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-mvuuh9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-mvuuh9h","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.广泛形成于沉积作用，如海盆或湖盆地中化学沉积的石膏，常与石灰岩、红色页岩、泥灰岩等成层出现。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-jae1z9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-jae1z9i","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.方解石 Calcite 参见“方解石”条"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-5coc3f6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-5coc3f6","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.产于内蒙古、甘肃、新疆、山东、安徽、湖北、湖南、广东、广西、四川、云南、西藏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-ezvttps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-ezvttps","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.方解石 Calcite 参见“方解石”条"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-rwnwjoi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-rwnwjoi","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-4dicecc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-4dicecc","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.晶体结构属单斜晶系。单个晶体呈板状，集合体呈块状、片状、纤维状或粉末状。无色或白色、粉红色。有时透明，具玻璃光泽，解理面显珍珠光泽，纤维状者显丝绢光泽。硬度2，薄片具挠性。相对密度2.3-2.37。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-xwtf7n1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-xwtf7n1","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.方解石 Calcite 参见“方解石”条"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-c3asm7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-c3asm7e","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-29yf4d7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-29yf4d7","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 (1）北寒水石 本品为纤维状集合体，呈扁平块状或厚板状。大小不一，厚0.5-3.5cm。淡红色，有的为白色；条痕白色。表面凹凸不平，侧面呈纵细纹理，具丝绢光泽。质较软，指甲可刻划成痕；易砸碎，断面显直立纤维状，粉红色。气微，味淡。以粉红色、有细丝纹、具光光泽、无杂石者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-0blxipo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-0blxipo","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2）南寒水石 参见“方解石”条。西藏产“南寒水石”主为粗粒状集合体，呈不规则块状，有棱角。主为浅棕褐色。具玻璃样光泽；半透明。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-swqv5o3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-swqv5o3","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 （1）北寒水石 透射偏光镜下：薄片中无色透明。旋旋旋旋光性特征参见“石膏”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-3vg6flj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-3vg6flj","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）南寒水石 参见“方解石”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-s3u56pr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-s3u56pr","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-ulwu195","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-ulwu195","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.北寒水石 主要成分为硫酸钙（CaSO4·2H2O）,尚含有铁、铝等杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-o9qwio9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-o9qwio9","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.南寒水石 主要成分是碳酸钙(CaCO3)，尚含镁、铁、锰、锌等杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-kvzz99r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-kvzz99r","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-8onrc85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-8onrc85","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）北寒水石 ①取本品一小块(约2g)，置具有小孔软木塞的试管内，灼烧，管壁有水生成，小块变为不透明体。（检查结晶水）。②取本品粉末约0.2g，加稀盐酸10ml，加热，使溶解，溶液呈钙盐与硫酸盐的鉴别反应。参见“石膏”条。③红外光谱定性分析：IR λKBrmax cm-1:3560,3410,3244,1150,1120,1004,673,663,604,455。与石膏图谱相同。④X射线衍射分析曲线：石膏7.76(\u003e10),4.30(8),3.82(9),3.08(10),2.88(3),2.80(1),2.70(2),2.61(1),2.54(1),2.23(2)。分析结果主要为石膏组成。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-me1p7yp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-me1p7yp","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）南寒水石 参见“方解石”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-31kb4xr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-31kb4xr","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-qg0e9zb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-qg0e9zb","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 心；胃；肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-rflddqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-rflddqj","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-34tqyx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-34tqyx3","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛咸；寒"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-z71z9iv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-z71z9iv","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-91l7j2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-91l7j2j","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 脾胃虚寒者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-1ciwrpe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-1ciwrpe","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草经集注》：畏地榆。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-miykurm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-miykurm","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：凡阴虚火旺，咳嗽吐血，多痰，潮热骨蒸，并脾胃作泄者不宜服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-atetsm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-atetsm9","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草求真》：虚人热浮，切忌。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-nvry9an","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-nvry9an","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-mty01w8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-mty01w8","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热降火；利窍；消肿。主时行热病；壮热烦渴；咽喉肿痛；水肿；尿闭；口舌生疮；痈疽；丹毒；烫伤"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-rdcnrgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-rdcnrgr","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-kvxaek1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-kvxaek1","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3-5钱；或入丸、散。外用：研末掺或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-l4yo9b6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-l4yo9b6","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-c196l0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-c196l0z","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治五脏六腑积熟，天行时气疫热，以致烦满消渴: 凝水石、石膏、滑石各五钱，甘草二钱。研末。每服一钱，白汤调服。 (《方脉正宗》)②治伤寒发狂，或弃衣奔走，逾墙上屋:寒水石、黄连(去须)各等分。上细末，每服二钱，浓煎甘草汤，放冷调服。(《本事方》鹊石散)③除热瘫痫: 大黄、干姜、龙骨各四两，桂枝三两，甘草、牡蛎各二两，寒水石、滑石、赤石脂、白石脂、紫石英、石膏各六两。上十二味，杵，粗筛，以韦囊盛之，取三指撮，井花水三升，煮三沸，温服一升。 (《金匮要略》风引汤)④治风热心躁， 口干狂言，浑身壮热及中诸毒:寒水石半斤(烧半日，净地坑内，盆合，四面湿土壅起，候经宿取出)，入甘草末、天竺黄各二两，龙脑二分。糯米膏丸，弹子大，蜜水磨下。 (《姚僧坦集验方》龙脑甘露丸)⑤治男女转脬，不得小便: 寒水石二两，滑石一两，葵子一合。为末。水一斗，煮五升，时服，一升即利。(《永类钤方》)⑥治小儿丹毒，皮肤热赤: 凝水石五钱，水调和猪胆汁涂之。(《本草汇言》)⑦治牙齿内血出，并有窍眼，时时吐血: 寒水石粉、朱砂、甘草、脑子。上等分，为细末。每用少许，干掺有窍处。(《普济方》)⑧治汤火伤灼: 寒水石烧研敷之。 (《卫生易简方》)"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-9pun67h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-9pun67h","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-vkqkvtu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-vkqkvtu","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：凝水石其气大寒，其味辛咸，入肾走血，除热之功，同于诸盐。古方所用寒水石是此石，唐、宋诸方寒水石是石膏，近方寒水石则是长石、方解石。用者详之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-v73nnx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-v73nnx5","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：凝水石，《本经》味辛气寒，《别录》加甘，大寒无毒。《经》曰，热之气，凉以和之，大热之气，寒以取之。又曰，热淫于内，治以咸寒。大寒微咸之性，故主身热邪气，皮中如火侥，烦满，及时气热盛。五脏伏热，胃中热也，易饥作渴，亦胃中伏火也，甘寒除阳明之邪热，故能止渴不饥。水肿者湿热也，小便多不利，以致水气上溢于腹，而成腹痹，辛咸走散之性，故能除热利窍消肿也。疗腹中积聚者，亦取其辛散咸软之功耳。凝水石，按本文云盐之精，则与石膏、方解石大相悬绝矣。因石膏有寒水石之名，而王隐君复云寒水石又名方解石，以致混淆难辨，其功能各不同，用者自宜分别。生卤地，味辛咸，碎之如朴硝者，是凝水石。其气大寒，能除有余邪热。《经》曰诸腹胀大，皆属于热者宜之，诸湿肿满属脾士者忌之，大宜详审，慎勿有误。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-b522s0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-b522s0u","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经逢原》 ；寒水石，治心肾积热之上药，《本经腹中积聚，咸能软坚也；身热皮中如火烧，咸能降火也。匮》风引汤，《局方》紫雪，皆用以治有余之邪热也、如无者，戎盐、玄精石皆可代用，总取咸寒降泄之用耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-19rn6u7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-19rn6u7","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本经》：主身热，腹中积聚邪气，皮中如火烧，烦满，水饮之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-w6t4mf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-w6t4mf0","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草经集注》：解巴豆毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-hj0p9hg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-hj0p9hg","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《别录》：除时气热盛，五脏伏热，胃中热，烦满，口渴，水肿，小腹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-nl5dj61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-nl5dj61","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《医学入门》：治小儿丹毒，烧为末，醋调敷之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-fio4erp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-fio4erp","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《纲目》：治小便白，内痹，凉血降火，止牙疼，坚牙明。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-2nuqqu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-2nuqqu5","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《医林纂要》：除妄热，治天行大热及霍乱吐泻，心烦口渴，湿热水肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-pi1tm4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-pi1tm4l","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《本草求真》：敷汤火伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-xzp4vqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-xzp4vqm","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《本草求原》：治心肾实热。"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-035ckt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-035ckt9","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611121709-9bdx6os","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121709-9bdx6os","updated":"20240611121709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611121710-jouq2aw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611121710-jouq2aw"}},{"ID":"20240611121711-ci8b0ad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611121711-ci8b0ad"}}]}